@startuml uc4-check-compatibility
title UC4 Check Pet Compatibility: compatibility rules (use case layer on main)

left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 60
hide empty members

package "Application Business Rules" as ABR #FDE2E2 {
  interface CompatibilityRule {
    + evaluate(pet : Pet, preferences : AdopterPreferences) : RuleResult
  }
  class ChildrenRule
  class OtherPetsRule
  class MedicalNeedsRule
  class RuleResult {
    trait : String
    status : Status
    explanation : String
  }
  enum "RuleResult.Status" as Status {
    MATCH
    CONFLICT
    NOT_APPLICABLE
  }
}

package "Enterprise Business Rules" as EBR #FFF4D6 {
  class Pet
  class AdopterPreferences
  enum Temperament
}

CompatibilityRule <|.. ChildrenRule
CompatibilityRule <|.. OtherPetsRule
CompatibilityRule <|.. MedicalNeedsRule
CompatibilityRule ..> RuleResult : returns
RuleResult --> Status
CompatibilityRule ..> Pet
CompatibilityRule ..> AdopterPreferences
ChildrenRule ..> Temperament
OtherPetsRule ..> Temperament

note bottom of RuleResult
  The interactor, controller, presenter and view
  for UC4 are not on main yet. Each rule is a
  separate class, so a new rule does not change
  the existing ones.
end note

@enduml
